        "Rivada Networks  is a US-based communications technology business with offices in the US and Ireland.",
        "Rivada Networks was founded on July 6, 2004 and its current CEO and chairman is Irish businessman Declan Ganley.",
        "Karl Rove, who is a paid lobbyist for Rivada, and Newt Gingrich have been lobbying since early 2019 for the DoD/Rivada deal which CNN says, would be \"premium real estate for the booming and lucrative 5G market.\" Rivada says that is \"not interested in a nationalized 5G network.\""
